Origname: gnome-menus-3.36.0
Name: gnome-menus

    gnome-menus 3.36.0 (freedesktop.org .menu file parsing, libgnome-menu-3). Created as groundwork; gnome-shell 46's meson does not hard-require it, but the shell's app-grid code falls back to it and having it installed is harmless.
